# ---- Other people's material: on the bench PC, never committed -------------------------------------------------
# Vendor datasheets (PDF), their text, and renders of their pages and drawings.  tools/jlc_datasheet.py (by LCSC
# code) and tools/adi_datasheet.py fetch them again.  Lattice's pinout table for the ECP5U-25 is among them
# (datasheets/FPGA-SC-02033-2-0-ECP5U-25-Pinout.csv): gen/fpga.py, tools/pin_tables.py and tools/check_pairs.py
# read it, so a fresh clone downloads it from Lattice before it can regenerate the FPGA's pins.
/datasheets/
/docs/datasheets/txt/
/docs/datasheets/drawings/g2406*.png
/docs/datasheets/drawings/hammond*.png
/docs/datasheets/drawings/led2835*.png
/docs/datasheets/drawings/rgb1615*.png
/docs/datasheets/drawings/sma*.png
/docs/datasheets/drawings/tcxo*.png
